{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world where dark magic and betrayal fester like a venomous wound, the kingdom stands on the precipice of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shadows of a cursed kingdom where monsters rule and justice is long forgotten. <i>Inferos Numine</i> is a dark action-adventure game where you play as a fallen demon, betrayed by your own kind and left to rot in the depths of the underworld. Now reborn through rage and fire, your only purpose is vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through legions of twisted demons and grotesque monsters as you uncover the truth behind your betrayal. Master brutal combat, harness infernal powers, and carve a bloody path through a decaying world ruled by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952670/extras/worm2.gif?t=1749417332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gripping dark fantasy story of betrayal, revenge, and redemption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense melee and magic combat against monstrous enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique demonic abilities that evolve with your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric environments filled with lore and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Epic boss battles that test your skill and willpower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you claim revenge... or become the very evil you swore to destroy?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1952670?t=1749417332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952670/0eb24bb8787c129944fa3b7e8c8f7e1fdea300eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749417332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor